# Project Overview

## Product Context
- This project is a React/Next.js application with mobile/web integration and AWS Amplify backend services.
- A key feature area is ride-along monitoring with live audio session tracking and turn/session history views.
- The app uses branded design tokens defined in `app/globals.css` for visual consistency.

## Technical Context
- Front-end uses React with client components in `app/components`.
- Backend/data integrations include Amplify GraphQL/API resources.
- Native audio session behavior is bridged through custom plugin code in `plugins` and iOS native files.

## Current Design Direction
- Prioritize clean, low-noise interfaces for operational monitoring panels.
- Keep interaction surfaces simple, readable, and aligned with brand tokens.

## Open Context To Confirm With User
